<title>USA: MER Telemanagement IPO postponed.</title>
<headline>MER Telemanagement IPO postponed.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The planned initial public offering of MER Telemanagement Inc has been postponed due to market conditions, lead underwriter Jefferies &amp; Co said on Friday.</p>
<p>The company, which makes call management systems, was planning to offer two million shares between $9 to $11 each.</p>
<p>The deal was tentatively scheduled to trade on Friday. Last year the initial public offering was also postponed.</p>
</text>
